    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Long-handled tools with a curved blade set perpendicular to the shaft and curving inwards towards it; used for cutting or slicing away the surface of wood, such as in dressing lumber. For similar tools but used for cutting, use "axes (tools)." [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
